<description>&lt;p&gt;Somalia is hosting regional talks in Egypt with leaders of Eritrea, Sudan and its own officials while maintaining neutrality as Ethiopia-Eritrea tensions rise. The federal government is screening travelers after Kenya confirmed an imported Ebola case and is seeking to repair ties with the UAE despite Somaliland tensions. Somali forces killed two al-Shabaab militants in the Bay region and the country secured the release of four Pakistani sailors from Somali pirates, while agreeing to acquire Pakistani JF‑17 fighter jets to deepen defence ties. The conflict caused 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxOVXRJWk5YWmNUZ2F4OHEzaFNXZWl3QWU2WnJ1bDlxXzdTMnNGaWFnTFBWOWlZRDA5U2pFdGN3MXU1X2o5TzJDQXJqR2libUlFSGpkWjBIVFJtbkV6czJZWXhpbWlZamREWl9TM0ZSUGtlSVpvb1FsS3ZrR2xkcWxCZ2pRcGM3ZDFzYldkUDFpa3p3Z2JOZ1pBT2liV3NnZnZ3NTZzcEFPaw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Garowe Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxQTzdMWW4xSEhGUDE1X1pMTzk1RHZKTXk3bHBOazJWYmozbl9DUW5Yd0UtLTgxV0hzWjZ4MjBtMWhPMGFXdkdQNDFVZXRfNHEyWHlwekctRmstN01MbzUxcWc1Ym4wR0UwdE5aellzQTBPZ21qZm9lQ0xzMGpYXzJXcVZhd1hNYzVrdVdGWHBobU1GRE9fTFM3MGVoTFVtWjM3Y0lEV1NIRk5Sbkl4clB2SUlB?oc=5&quot;&gt;FTL Somalia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxPRUNaOE44X216ZGE4OHBpeV9sREhjTG9XRXRveFBubUREZnRDTGdmbU9LcnBaTjFuRG1IRzVaWWlra1RXc0VrZlk1ejR0bERBTFg1b0NvWEhfWTkwcl9oS3ktR0xEUFBRQjFZT0ltZWRzRU0wZEdEU3FGVGQyWUdvRGlvOE12dndDeEpkdmd4NzFxVHAzNHBhUVpFUy03R0JoVnpDYlpLbVdEQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali National